<TextPage title="Affiliate disclosure" description="Learn how affiliate links support God First Deals and what that means for your shopping."><div class="prose"><h2>How affiliate links work</h2><p>Some links on God First Deals are affiliate links. If you click one and make a qualifying purchase, we may receive a commission from the retailer or affiliate network. This comes at no additional cost to you.</p><h2>Our approach</h2><p>Affiliate relationships help support the work of maintaining this site. They do not mean a product is guaranteed to perform as advertised, nor do they change the retailer’s pricing, availability, shipping, or return terms.</p><p>Product details and availability can change. Please verify current information directly with the retailer before purchasing. Retailers are responsible for transactions, fulfilment, customer service, and returns.</p><h2>Questions?</h2><p>For questions about this disclosure, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p></div></TextPage>
